# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened[[cite:obs-15360ef4c91d7872edf71622a82b46af9819b05c "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]]. Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation[[cite:obs-767353eaf7bab0dc60b2ca44e0cc00cc7925340e "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
